{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1e364b01be454eaac80c73b2538f3edf6ba0c1bfad49dbd5c3f0bb0f07316427"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The platform targets IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code, CLI, Desktop JVM, Android, iOS, JS/WASM web, and server runtimes, with distribution via JetBrains Marketplace, VS Code Marketplace, npm, a web app, and GitHub Releases (iOS built from source)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1ea351d1a102fcb7b1fab5ff9715ef59d8dec562e8c9684882c00aae361a2aef"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The default Gradle build includes mpp-core (shared agent engine with tools, MCP integration, and AGENTS.md loading), mpp-ui, mpp-server (a Ktor-based remote coding agent server), viewer modules, and xiuper support modules, with mpp-idea as a composite build."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2c83ec2aa2605352a473e6a79491ceaa2a0d6b057e6395bd3524b0fbe08650ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime performs automatic AGENTS.md discovery across the project hierarchy and injects project rules into prompts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_31034b51274a60f57d411864de01161f9827ea5c7d0f13af67cc8689ab1ad415"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Multi-LLM support is claimed for OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, Ollama, and more, and code intelligence uses tree-sitter parsing for Java, Kotlin, Python, JS/TS, Go, Rust, and C#."},{"claim_ids":["clm_47673e63cd180e4c3d686a33122e7fc67349517b5163551288398ec433249ed1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"AutoDev Xiuper is described as an AI-native, multi-agent development platform built on Kotlin Multiplatform, focused on document research, coding, code review, data query, artifact generation, and web interaction workflows."},{"claim_ids":["clm_56036429237f95dc05f57bfb9028c076f02d222e61fc4e21cc57deba999fc2a4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"SubAgents follow an 'agent as tool' pattern in which the main Coding Agent invokes specialized micro-agents (NanoDSL, PlotDSL, Chart, Analysis, Codebase Investigator, and others) for focused sub-tasks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_78d56693a8edcaa4b0e8183e02009fd0107e63f4c53bd0c46a125ddb10aa2230"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The code is distributed under the MPL 2.0 license, and AutoDev 2.0 remains available on a separate branch and as a stable plugin."},{"claim_ids":["clm_98369a6ab8b56dc081bcdca9b827c7bacd03aacf923c6054dd625aa90463fcee"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent ecosystem support includes MCP, A2A agent commands, Claude Skill loading, and SpecKit command integration."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a681f694e95fb34de3ab5e6aca29c34fcbc3f66a75bdf3be4e3fedcb401f6d08"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Testing capability exists mainly through xiuper-e2e and E2E-oriented agent/tooling work and is not yet represented as a clearly separated top-level agent in the current code layout."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b0e0f8995a4636dc7b22ae95513ead2998077a42476f3c1221de30c3a71b97ad"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"mpp-vscode, mpp-ios, and mpp-web are maintained in the repository but are not part of the current root settings.gradle.kts default build graph."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c9d097556cf84596f715d49c21c55715bd856024522985399487458e080ec428"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The coding agent is tool-driven, with built-in file system, grep/glob, shell, web fetch, and MCP tools plus renderer integration, per the README feature list."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fc1bd74cd54fb90cae02f4330e7c0a29c7eb93ff18cb6b0cb90219b840f60895"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Five top-level agents are listed as code-backed: DocumentAgent, CodingAgent, CodeReviewAgent, ChatDBAgent, and ArtifactAgent; a web agent/WebEdit flow exists but is marked experimental."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1e364b01be454eaac80c73b2538f3edf6ba0c1bfad49dbd5c3f0bb0f07316427","clm_1ea351d1a102fcb7b1fab5ff9715ef59d8dec562e8c9684882c00aae361a2aef","clm_2c83ec2aa2605352a473e6a79491ceaa2a0d6b057e6395bd3524b0fbe08650ba","clm_31034b51274a60f57d411864de01161f9827ea5c7d0f13af67cc8689ab1ad415","clm_47673e63cd180e4c3d686a33122e7fc67349517b5163551288398ec433249ed1","clm_56036429237f95dc05f57bfb9028c076f02d222e61fc4e21cc57deba999fc2a4","clm_78d56693a8edcaa4b0e8183e02009fd0107e63f4c53bd0c46a125ddb10aa2230","clm_98369a6ab8b56dc081bcdca9b827c7bacd03aacf923c6054dd625aa90463fcee","clm_a681f694e95fb34de3ab5e6aca29c34fcbc3f66a75bdf3be4e3fedcb401f6d08","clm_b0e0f8995a4636dc7b22ae95513ead2998077a42476f3c1221de30c3a71b97ad","clm_c9d097556cf84596f715d49c21c55715bd856024522985399487458e080ec428","clm_fc1bd74cd54fb90cae02f4330e7c0a29c7eb93ff18cb6b0cb90219b840f60895"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_45d13bd5237545b3af0aa79e9954a5dc","id":"pg_39a77f55ee5c50b190976f4b4d377424","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/phodal-auto-dev-readme-md-23777fe2d3f1-6f4b4d377424.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_bd0ea77e4c375982b31ad69786a73052"],"title":"phodal/auto-dev/README.md @ 23777fe2d3f1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45d13bd5237545b3af0aa79e9954a5dc"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_3960302a3d592a9f90123e3a622e7264c7c7e01dbef82e44f53eecc96fc81747"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: documented commands cover CLI testing via Gradle and npm, IDEA plugin compilation, targeted renderer tests, and buildPlugin."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b05896e30b2e5cce2148e5b821ac5c3365f51d18f4cd5748336e5d86a041789c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENTS.md instructs contributors to run builds and tests before completing tasks, use per-module clean instead of global clean, place temporary scripts under docs/test-scripts, and check ~/.autodev/logs/autodev-app.log for debugging."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e1d6dee448e2bcc545acac8ba89ccfc30530b058a49dd9e97c09ddd4a5216918"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors must update all CodingAgentRenderer implementations (Kotlin, TypeScript, VSCode, and JVM CLI variants) when modifying it, and follow expect/actual and @JsExport conventions for KMP code."}],"claim_ids":["clm_3960302a3d592a9f90123e3a622e7264c7c7e01dbef82e44f53eecc96fc81747","clm_b05896e30b2e5cce2148e5b821ac5c3365f51d18f4cd5748336e5d86a041789c","clm_e1d6dee448e2bcc545acac8ba89ccfc30530b058a49dd9e97c09ddd4a5216918"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_45d13bd5237545b3af0aa79e9954a5dc","id":"pg_82fb3132849950f891899e5f4d55526d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/phodal-auto-dev-agents-md-23777fe2d3f1-9e5f4d55526d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_740c04925dc259adbcccfcfe56f379ff"],"title":"phodal/auto-dev/AGENTS.md @ 23777fe2d3f1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_45d13bd5237545b3af0aa79e9954a5dc"}
